                                "target_word": "vehemently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e141230-e9ab-3daa-b691-74c7fb605946",
                                        "entry_id": "450a14d2-a1f0-3e80-a75a-237f44d3b172",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a vehement manner; expressing with a strong or forceful attitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "510a53b2-b959-4455-b1be-689d9cfda2d8",
                                                "sense_id": "8e141230-e9ab-3daa-b691-74c7fb605946",
                                                "text": "vehemently opposed"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79af6ac3-a422-4e92-a81e-33c05433c343",
                                                "sense_id": "8e141230-e9ab-3daa-b691-74c7fb605946",
                                                "text": "The Rabbis adjured her to endow the young man with his former virility, but she vehemently refused to do so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e909c84b-40b4-468a-a23e-ffefce3f0b49",
                                                "sense_id": "8e141230-e9ab-3daa-b691-74c7fb605946",
                                                "text": "Critics were vehemently outspoken; but while they fretted about looks, they missed the cleverer points in the design itself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9833a2d1-ffab-428b-b519-15a5999a5463",
                                                "sense_id": "8e141230-e9ab-3daa-b691-74c7fb605946",
                                                "text": "After all, you heard them accusing me at an earlier date and much more vehemently than these more recent accusers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f006e01c-de6d-468c-9462-e97662990e67",
                                                "sense_id": "8e141230-e9ab-3daa-b691-74c7fb605946",
                                                "text": "And it was a miserable afternoon for Chelsea and England captain John Terry at the end of a week in which has he faced allegations of racial abuse against QPR's Anton Ferdinand - claims he vehemently denies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
